@{
   ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
   ExpenseWise runs on the computer or server where your group installed it. Account details (name, email, phone),
   groups, expenses, and repayments are stored in that installation's MySQL database and are visible to members of the
   same group as described below. ExpenseWise does not send this data to third parties or process payments.
</p>
<ul>
   <li>Group members can see the group's members, expenses, shares, balances, and repayment history.</li>
   <li>Only the group organizer can change the group, add members, record or void expenses, and record repayments.</li>
   <li>Accounts and records with financial history cannot be deleted in this release.</li>
</ul>
<p>Contact the person who operates your installation about backups, retention, or data removal.</p>